     7→// - Make `SszWrite::write_fixed` accept `&mut GenericArray<u8, _>` or `&mut [u8; _]`.
     8→// - Make the traits operate on implementors of `std::io::Read` and `std::io::Write`.
     9→//   This would make the code significantly more complicated with no clear benefit.
